# IMX round 4: per track pattern length (polymeter). Track 1 is cut to 4 steps while track 2 keeps the pattern length, both play a note on step 1 (Synth 1). The trace counts the note ons per note: the short track sounds about four times as often
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini  (setup pokes in plus_flows.sh, the poke trace UISHOT_TRACE_FFSTATE is the read, poke_ok in plus_flows.sh)
title: per track pattern length (Tracker Mini, IMX round 4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

wait 1500ms
tap Fn1
wait 3000ms
tap Play
wait 9000ms
shot plen-playing
tap Play
wait 1500ms
shot plen-stopped
